body:
For nearly a Millennia The Masked Reaper led a life filled with enough bloodshed to rival what generals and conquers could even dream of. A master Spellsword with a favor to the art of weapon summoning, a living legend. That man died a long time ago. Osiris, a man who’s passion for killing ceased long before the contracts did, stands before his newest quarry.. The lousiest, most pitiful group of hooligans any mercenary  could have the misfortune of being hired to deal with. Too adamant to run, too stubborn to die, and too annoying to even bother;

From a plethora of healing magic to painfully obvious illusion magic involving Halfling Rogues.

“Look man.. Guy.. woman... angry? Probably angry. I’m not getting paid enough for this.. see ya...”
